{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:971e0f7ae93bda80","name":"Zeison Sha Warrior Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-971e0f7ae93bda80","title":"Zeison Sha Warrior Talent Tree","revision":25652,"timestamp":"2024-12-04T23:45:24Z","sha256":"7d504c61ee40a7d48e9786946c557f3a74a477c7d352217a70f56006ec779586","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25652","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Zeison%20Sha%20Warrior%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-971e0f7ae93bda80","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Zeison Sha talented enough to become Warriors focus their powers on manipulating the objects around them. They are also masters of their signature weapon: the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Discblade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Discblade","referenceId":"reference:851ee9a1235d2f50"},". Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Zeison Sha"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Zeison_Sha","referenceId":"reference:852a93459f3db5f9"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Discblade Arc"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," Proficient with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Discblade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Discblade","referenceId":"reference:851ee9a1235d2f50"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", you can make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," with your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Discblade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Discblade","referenceId":"reference:851ee9a1235d2f50"},", striking three targets, all of which must be within Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," for your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Discblade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Discblade","referenceId":"reference:851ee9a1235d2f50"},". This attack uses the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," rules; you make one attack roll and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of every target you designate.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Distant Discblade Throw"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," Proficient with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Discblade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Discblade","referenceId":"reference:851ee9a1235d2f50"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Discblade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Discblade","referenceId":"reference:851ee9a1235d2f50"},", you treat it as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," (instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Thrown Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Thrown_Weapon"},") for the purpose of determining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Recall Discblade"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," Proficient with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Discblade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Discblade","referenceId":"reference:851ee9a1235d2f50"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Discblade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Discblade","referenceId":"reference:851ee9a1235d2f50"}," (or use the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Discblade Arc"]}," Talent above), after the attack is resolved you can make a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check to call the weapon back to your hand as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Telekinetic Vigilance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Intercept"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intercept","referenceId":"reference:1b6926403a450862"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can return the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Intercept"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intercept","referenceId":"reference:1b6926403a450862"}]}," Force Power to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", without spending a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Weapon Specialization (Discblade)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus (Discblade)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Discblade)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls with your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Discblade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Discblade","referenceId":"reference:851ee9a1235d2f50"},".\n"]},"\n"]}}
